sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant L as Leader
    participant W as Workers (N shards)

    C->>L: run(queries, chunks_per_query, top_k)
    L->>W: create shard group

    loop each query
        L->>W: search_chunks(query_index)
        W->>W: fake query embedding,<br/>score chunks (dot product),<br/>keep local top-K
        W-->>L: top-K chunk ids + scores
        L->>L: merge candidates,<br/>sort, keep global top-K
    end

    L->>L: collect per-node and per-role stats
    L-->>C: top chunks per query, queries/sec, timing
